7] [17592186554521 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186553864 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554521 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "d777c8fd-8f4e-5ca8-a5be-b50636868cd0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554541 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186554475 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554541 #edb/ref 1069 "q-102712" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554541 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554541 #edb/ref 1071 "Consider the surface ${z}^{2}y+16=4\\sqrt{x}+y.$ Find the equation of the tangent plane to that surface at the point $(4,-1,3).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554541 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "138bcf11-9efc-57ee-ad7b-ef21818db0e7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554541 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we bring all variables to one side:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{z}^{2}y+16 & =4\\sqrt{x}+y. \\\\ {z}^{2}y-4\\sqrt{x}-y & =-16\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIf we set $f(x,y,z)={z}^{2}y-4\\sqrt{x}-y$, our surface can be viewed as the level surface $f(x,y,z)=-16.$ \n\nRecall that the equation of the tangent plane to the level surface $f(x,y,z)=k$ at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ can be expressed as\n\n$$\n∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0},\\,z-{z}_{0}⟩=0.\n$$\n\nNow, we find the gradient of $f(x,y,z)$ and evaluate it at $(4,-1,3):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇\\,f(x,y,z) & ={f}_{x}(x,y,z)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y,z)\\,j+{f}_{z}(x,y,z)\\,k \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}({z}^{2}y-4\\sqrt{x}-y)\\text{ }i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}({z}^{2}y-4\\sqrt{x}-y)\\text{ }j+\\frac{∂}{∂z}({z}^{2}y-4\\sqrt{x}-y)\\text{ }k \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{x}}\\text{ }i+({z}^{2}-1)\\text{ }j+2zy\\text{ }k \\\\ ∇\\,f(4,-1,3) & =-\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4}}\\text{ }i+({3}^{2}-1)\\text{ }j+2(3)(-1)\\text{ }k \\\\  & =-\\,i+8\\text{ }j-6\\,k \\\\  & =⟨-1,8,-6⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we can now write down the Cartesian equation of the tangent plane to the level surface, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0},\\,z-{z}_{0}⟩ & =0 \\\\ ∇f(4,-1,3)\\cdot ⟨x-4,\\,y+1,\\,z-3⟩ & =0 \\\\ ⟨-1,8,-6⟩\\cdot ⟨x-4,\\,y+1,\\,z-3⟩ & =0 \\\\ -(x-4)+8(y+1)-6(z-3) & =0 \\\\ -x+8y-6z+30 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554672 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186554715 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554672 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "48086a64-8671-5a00-bbb5-b58661fd7a59" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554672 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186554623 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554677 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186554672 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554677 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "588c4361-50c9-5029-a566-867e8863cbe8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554677 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186366808 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554682 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186554749 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554682 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "7191b9bd-5ed6-54dc-8494-3debf9947402" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554682 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186394071 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554715 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "9ee2cdbe-40de-5a18-809a-b2ba9fbc04a8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554715 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186554541 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554749 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186554677 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554749 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "fb365c06-0aef-539e-aff8-8e2d2bf57273" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186554749 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186554584 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
